<header class="page-header">
  <div class="doc-label">Research Framework &mdash; LS&ndash;002 &mdash; Asoluka LLC</div>
  <h1>The Literary Productivity Frontier</h1>
  <p class="page-desc">A remix of Porter&rsquo;s Productivity Frontier. We replace the focus on cost and efficiency with well-being. The question becomes: how do communities use their flow of assets&mdash;and how do restrictions shape their capacity to thrive?</p>
  <p class="page-desc" style="margin-top: 0.8rem;">The Frontier operates in two movements. First, it maps the flow of assets inside the novel&mdash;how characters survive, reform, or agitate within the systems they inherit. Then it crosses over: the same framework becomes the basis for strategic response in the real community. The novel is the diagnostic. The Frontier is the instrument.</p>
</header>

<!-- ── ANIMATED DIAGRAM ── -->
<div class="frontier-container">
  <div class="frontier-diagram" id="frontier">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 800 500" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
      <defs>
        <!-- arrowheads -->
        <marker id="ah-surv" markerWidth="8" markerHeight="8" refX="7" refY="4" orient="auto">
          <path d="M 0 1 L 7 4 L 0 7" fill="none" stroke="#00cccc" stroke-width="1.5"/>
        </marker>
        <marker id="ah-ref" markerWidth="8" markerHeight="8" refX="7" refY="4" orient="auto">
          <path d="M 0 1 L 7 4 L 0 7" fill="none" stroke="#44cc44" stroke-width="1.5"/>
        </marker>
        <marker id="ah-agi" markerWidth="8" markerHeight="8" refX="7" refY="4" orient="auto">
          <path d="M 0 1 L 7 4 L 0 7" fill="none" stroke="#ff44aa" stroke-width="1.5"/>
        </marker>
        <!-- gradient fill under curve -->
        <radialGradient id="zoneGrad" cx="100%" cy="0%" r="100%">
          <stop offset="0%" stop-color="rgba(242,242,242,0.08)"/>
          <stop offset="100%" stop-color="rgba(242,242,242,0.01)"/>
        </radialGradient>
      </defs>

      <!-- grid lines -->
      <g opacity="0.06">
        <line x1="100" y1="60" x2="100" y2="420" stroke="#f2f2f2" stroke-width="0.5"/>
        <line x1="250" y1="60" x2="250" y2="420" stroke="#f2f2f2" stroke-width="0.5"/>
        <line x1="400" y1="60" x2="400" y2="420" stroke="#f2f2f2" stroke-width="0.5"/>
        <line x1="550" y1="60" x2="550" y2="420" stroke="#f2f2f2" stroke-width="0.5"/>
        <line x1="700" y1="60" x2="700" y2="420" stroke="#f2f2f2" stroke-width="0.5"/>
        <line x1="100" y1="130" x2="720" y2="130" stroke="#f2f2f2" stroke-width="0.5"/>
        <line x1="100" y1="200" x2="720" y2="200" stroke="#f2f2f2" stroke-width="0.5"/>
        <line x1="100" y1="270" x2="720" y2="270" stroke="#f2f2f2" stroke-width="0.5"/>
        <line x1="100" y1="340" x2="720" y2="340" stroke="#f2f2f2" stroke-width="0.5"/>
      </g>

      <!-- axes (thick L) -->
      <line x1="100" y1="420" x2="720" y2="420" stroke="#f2f2f2" stroke-width="2"/>
      <line x1="100" y1="420" x2="100" y2="55" stroke="#f2f2f2" stroke-width="2"/>

      <!-- axis labels -->
      <text x="420" y="455" text-anchor="middle" class="axis-label">Survival</text>
      <text x="55" y="240" text-anchor="middle" class="axis-label" transform="rotate(-90, 55, 240)">Reform</text>

      <!-- frontier curve (Porter-style: concave, bowing OUTWARD from origin) -->
      <path d="M 105 80 C 480 78, 695 230, 700 418"
            class="frontier-curve" id="curve"/>

      <!-- fill inside frontier (area between curve and axes) -->
      <path d="M 105 80 C 480 78, 695 230, 700 418 L 700 420 L 100 420 L 100 80 Z"
            class="zone-fill" id="zoneFill" fill="url(#zoneGrad)"/>

      <!-- frontier label (along the curve) -->
      <text x="480" y="140" class="frontier-label" id="frontierLabel" transform="rotate(-58, 480, 140)">The Frontier</text>

      <!-- innovation label at apex of curve -->
      <text x="140" y="65" class="strategy-label" id="innovLabel" style="font-size: 14px;">Innovation</text>
      <text x="140" y="50" class="strategy-sublabel" id="innovSub" style="font-size: 7px;">Beyond the frontier</text>

      <!-- ── STARTING POINT (orange X, well inside the frontier) ── -->
      <g id="startPoint" opacity="0">
        <line x1="250" y1="330" x2="270" y2="350" stroke="#ff8844" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/>
        <line x1="270" y1="330" x2="250" y2="350" stroke="#ff8844" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/>
      </g>

      <!-- ── SURVIVAL ARROW (horizontal right toward frontier, cyan) ── -->
      <line x1="280" y1="340" x2="530" y2="340"
            stroke="#00cccc" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#ah-surv)"
            class="dir-arrow" id="survArrow" opacity="0"/>
      <text x="540" y="337" class="strategy-label" id="survLabel" style="fill: #00cccc; font-size: 11px;">Survival</text>
      <text x="540" y="353" class="strategy-sublabel" id="survSub" style="fill: #00aaaa; font-size: 7px;">Immediate fixes</text>

      <!-- ── REFORM ARROW (vertical up toward frontier, green) ── -->
      <line x1="260" y1="320" x2="260" y2="130"
            stroke="#44cc44" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#ah-ref)"
            class="dir-arrow" id="refArrow" opacity="0"/>
      <text x="225" y="115" text-anchor="middle" class="strategy-label" id="refLabel" style="fill: #44cc44; font-size: 11px;">Reform</text>
      <text x="225" y="102" text-anchor="middle" class="strategy-sublabel" id="refSub" style="fill: #33aa33; font-size: 7px;">Systemic improvement</text>

      <!-- ── AGITATION ARROW (diagonal, pushing past frontier, magenta) ── -->
      <line x1="273" y1="327" x2="530" y2="120"
            stroke="#ff44aa" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#ah-agi)"
            class="dir-arrow" id="agiArrow" opacity="0"/>
      <text x="540" y="115" class="strategy-label" id="agiLabel" style="fill: #ff44aa; font-size: 11px;">Agitate</text>
      <text x="540" y="131" class="strategy-sublabel" id="agiSub" style="fill: #cc3388; font-size: 7px;">Radical rethinking</text>

      <!-- ── MARKER X's on/near frontier ── -->
      <!-- cyan X (on frontier, high survival end) -->
      <g id="dotCyan" opacity="0">
        <line x1="618" y1="348" x2="634" y2="364" stroke="#00cccc" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
        <line x1="634" y1="348" x2="618" y2="364" stroke="#00cccc" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
      </g>
      <!-- green X (on frontier, high reform end) -->
      <g id="dotGreen" opacity="0">
        <line x1="175" y1="73" x2="191" y2="89" stroke="#44cc44" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
        <line x1="191" y1="73" x2="175" y2="89" stroke="#44cc44" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
      </g>
      <!-- magenta X (beyond frontier, outside the curve) -->
      <g id="dotMagenta" opacity="0">
        <line x1="470" y1="88" x2="486" y2="104" stroke="#ff44aa" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
        <line x1="486" y1="88" x2="470" y2="104" stroke="#ff44aa" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
      </g>
    </svg>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ── STRATEGY CARDS ── -->
<div class="strategies">
  <div class="strategy-card reveal">
    <div class="sc-num">Strategy 01</div>
    <div class="sc-name">Survival</div>
    <div class="sc-question">What do you do right now?</div>
    <p class="sc-desc">Immediate, short-term fixes for individuals or small groups. The underlying system doesn&rsquo;t change. The need is met today. Tomorrow the same problem returns.</p>
    <div class="sc-example">
      <span class="sc-example-label">Example</span>
      A neighbor drives one family to a clinic for medical care. The family&rsquo;s immediate need is met&mdash;but the clinic&rsquo;s restrictive hours and the transportation gaps remain for everyone else.
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="strategy-card reveal">
    <div class="sc-num">Strategy 02</div>
    <div class="sc-name">Reform</div>
    <div class="sc-question">How do you improve the system you have?</div>
    <p class="sc-desc">Systemic improvements within the existing framework. More people benefit. The flow of assets improves. The community moves closer to the frontier.</p>
    <div class="sc-example">
      <span class="sc-example-label">Example</span>
      A community petitions the city for extended clinic hours and a new bus route. Access improves for a larger group. The flow of assets&mdash;doctors, medication&mdash;moves more freely within the current system.
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="strategy-card reveal">
    <div class="sc-num">Strategy 03</div>
    <div class="sc-name">Agitation</div>
    <div class="sc-question">Who set the rules&mdash;and why?</div>
    <p class="sc-desc">Radical rethinking that challenges the design itself. Not improving the system&mdash;redesigning it. This pushes beyond the frontier. It redefines what &ldquo;optimal&rdquo; even means.</p>
    <div class="sc-example">
      <span class="sc-example-label">Example</span>
      Families campaign to overhaul healthcare policy altogether&mdash;ensuring that appointment times, locations, and funding structures reflect the needs of historically marginalized communities.
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<a href="/newcomm/" class="next-page">
  <div>
    <div class="next-label">Continue Reading</div>
    <div class="next-title">NewComm &mdash; Literary Science at Full Scale</div>
  </div>
  <div class="next-arrow">&rarr;</div>
</a>

<footer>
  <div class="footer-left">Literary Science</div>
